    <briefdescription>
<para>A special type of <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_v_p_basic_block" kindref="compound">VPBasicBlock</ref> that wraps an existing IR basic block. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Recipes of the block get added before the first non-phi instruction in the wrapped block. Note: At the moment, <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_v_p_i_r_basic_block" kindref="compound">VPIRBasicBlock</ref> can only be used to wrap <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_v_plan" kindref="compound">VPlan</ref>&apos;s preheader block. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
